    "Reintroduce some direct shoulder work, particularly rear delt and rotator cuff exercises like face pulls or band pull-aparts. These directly support back health and pulling performance.",
    "Log your biceps work with a slight progression target next period — even a small weight increase — since they are a direct synergist to all your pulling movements and their strength index has stalled at 104."
  ],
  "contextSummary": "Back strength index surged from 106 to 110 with 12 sets and dominant volume share; all other groups held flat with chest and shoulders notably under-served — watch push-pull balance while maintaining back priority."
